{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>And the man said: The woman whom You gave, etc.</b> That which Scripture says — repaying bad for good. לא תמוש רעה — ס\"ת, האשה. For he was ungrateful regarding the woman whom He gave him as a helpmate." "<b>She gave me from the tree and I ate.</b> According to the plain sense: she struck me with the tree until I listened to her words."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:15:35.369031164Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}